{"id":99662079,"slug":"errors-of-spelling-and-grammur-are","title":"Errors of spelling and grammur are the new black","subtitle":"How they Birth of AI will create a Renaissance for bad speller’s, punctuation terrible grammar. ","post_date":"2023-01-30T02:46:14.649Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/errors-of-spelling-and-grammur-are","wordcount":395,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T22:00:38.876Z","body_sha256":"8b902edec9964571e35ce373a46ae199fe853e2e8e803fee7e8c4c25b46c8dc3","text_words":400,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Some people may notice that the Substack has errors. There are errors of grammar. There are errors in punctuation. There are sometimes errors of spelling.</p><p>clearly I am a genius who saw the future.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A6vd!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c3cfdd8-bb79-4302-8577-a03dd47e2edc_3072x2048.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A6vd!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c3cfdd8-bb79-4302-8577-a03dd47e2edc_3072x2048.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A6vd!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c3cfdd8-bb79-4302-8577-a03dd47e2edc_3072x2048.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A6vd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c3cfdd8-bb79-4302-8577-a03dd47e2edc_3072x2048.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A6vd!,w_14